# 21. Helm Commands

Search charts:

```bash
helm search repo nginx
```

Install:

```bash
helm install myapp ./chart
```

List releases:

```bash
helm list
```

Upgrade:

```bash
helm upgrade myapp ./chart
```

Rollback:

```bash
helm rollback myapp 1
```

Delete:

```bash
helm uninstall myapp
```

